cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Compilation.jl: Tensor-network compilation of Kitaev honeycomb states into shallow quantum circuits"
abstract: >-
  A Julia/ITensor code that variationally compiles stored matrix-product-state
  ground states of the Kitaev honeycomb model on cylinders (including the
  three-spin time-reversal-breaking term) into shallow, symmetry-sector-
  preserving circuits of two-qubit Pauli rotations.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Xiao
    given-names: Bo
    email: boxiao.phys@gmail.com
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/xiaobo-23/Compilation"
version: "0.1.0"
keywords:
  - Kitaev honeycomb model
  - tensor networks
  - matrix product states
  - quantum circuit compilation
  - quantum state preparation
  - chiral spin liquid
